Cell["\<\
Diffuse draws every realisation at once, the more often a vertex is used the \
stronger; Branch follows one construction to the end. Without Fixed every \
step is solved over all branches of the earlier ones, and their number \
multiplies.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"eeb9abba-8be2-4482-b047-b3fd45274fa5"],

